    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grangehill Farm offers a rare opportunity to acquire a charming and character-filled residence standing on C. 1.85 St. Acres of excellent quality Golden Vale land, situated in an idyllic and peaceful countryside setting, yet within approximately 20 minutes` drive of Limerick City.\n\nApproached via a short, attractive tree-lined driveway, this delightful residence boasts many of its original features while offering comfortable accommodation and the conveniences of modern-day living. The property is well maintained throughout and enjoys a wonderful sense of warmth and character.\n\nThe spacious accommodation comprises an entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen, sun lounge, utility room, four bedrooms, including one ensuite, together with a main shower room.\n\nOutside, the property benefits from a traditional-style farmyard incorporating a three-column haybarn with lean-to, two stables and a range of ancillary out-offices. To the rear is a paddock laid out in permanent pasture, providing an ideal facility for equestrian use or those seeking the benefits of a small holding. There is also a lawned area to the front of the residence.\n\nThe property enjoys an idyllic location approximately five minutes` drive from Lough Gur Lake, Ballyneety Golf Club and Bruff, while Limerick City is within approximately a 20-minute commute, providing access to a comprehensive range of shopping, educational, recreational and transport amenities.\n\nFor those seeking a larger holding, there is also a separate adjoining property extending to approximately 22.5 statute acres currently available on the market, providing an excellent opportunity to acquire additional land if required.\n\nEarly viewing of this exceptional property comes highly recommended by GVM Auctioneers, sole selling agents.\nContact Richard Ryan on 087 8067772.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 11'9\" (3.58m) x 8'4\" (2.54m)\n\nSiting Room - 12'10\" (3.91m) x 11'6\" (3.51m)\nWith laminated wooden floor, cast iron fireplace with Mahogony surround and insert stove.\n\nKitchen - 14'4\" (4.37m) x 11'9\" (3.58m)\nWith tiled floor, fitted units & oil fired Stanley oven.\n\nSun Lounge - 11'4\" (3.45m) x 11'9\" (3.58m)\nWith tiled floor French patio doors leading to rear.\n\nUtility - 6'5\" (1.96m) x 6'3\" (1.91m)\nWith tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine.\n\nShower Room - 9'2\" (2.79m) x 6'3\" (1.91m)\nFully tiled with electric shower, toilet & wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom No 1 - 10'0\" (3.05m) x 9'0\" (2.74m)\n\nBedroom No 2 - 12'7\" (3.84m) x 7'8\" (2.34m)\n\nBedroom No 3 - 11'9\" (3.58m) x 8'9\" (2.67m)\nWith built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom No 4 - 12'6\" (3.81m) x 8'8\" (2.64m)\nWith built in wardrobe.\n\nEnsuite - 5'0\" (1.52m) x 7'10\" (2.39m)\nWith wash hand basin, toilet and shower cubicle with electric shower.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Oil fired Central Heating. </li><li> DG Woodgrain UPVC windows. </li><li> Lough Gur Group Water supply. </li><li> Septic tank sewerage system. </li><li> E2 BER.</li></ul>"
      },
      {
