      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Limerick take the Bruff Road (R512) via Ballyneety, at the Hamlet Bar turn left and proceed up the hill (The Old Road) for approximately 1.3 KM the subject property is on the left hand side.\n\nGPS Co-ordinates; 52.528512, -8.547704 or alternatively use Eircode: V35 C854.\n"
